            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Rusi Amoabut Naomi atiar, “Mere kalot kwana mana airar alunuran nuka akima, ka aitup da ŋin yenikadumakini asianut kakonycneke.” Kotema ŋes atiar, “Ape cabo, akokuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu kolot, kobu airar toma amana naesakiata ikasakak; ido kodum alukat naka amana naka Boas, loarai loka ekek leka Elimelek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
