        {
          "text": " Koboŋok Boas kobala ŋes ebe, “Aponi kalimonokin cut kere nuibu kiswamak tataakon ageun kaneatwania ekilekon: ido kwape ibu ijo kopalia papakon ka totokon ka akwap da nakolo kiwurikinio, kobu otuŋa lumam apeŋo iieni, ",
