          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi nakedol apak nakainyam, abu Eoas kobala ŋes ebe, “Bia ainyam atap, kieunyak aodunetekon odia loedwar.” Kiboikin ŋesi awai naka ikasakak; apotu koinakis ŋes imomwa luikawooritai, konyamkimonikin kokurwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kenyou airar, kicorak Boas iketelepai, kotema atiar, “Kirarunun ŋesi koisutan da konye siriretanakinete ŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komudanakinete ŋes da koisutan, kinyeis, kirar ŋes alopet, konye mam ilimunete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
