          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibwoko, koloma ore; abu tataake koany nuatukonokinit ŋesi; koyau koinak lunan edeuni neai nakedau aimonikin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi tataake kobala ebe, “Ai bo lolo kirararit? Ido ai bo kiswamaarit? Koinakinai asuliany ŋol loabu kojen jo.” Kitejenik ŋesi tataake ŋol loeswamaete kaŋes, kinera ebe, “Ekiliokit lokiswamaa lolo ekekiror Boas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
