            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiner Rusi Amoabut ebe, “Ee ba, abu ŋesi katema eoŋ ebe, ‘Kojaenena die kitelepaika aitodol naedauniata aisak nuka kere,’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi Naomi atemar Rusi ateranike ebe, “Ejok, akokuka, koupananasi nepepe kabulesinike, kwabo kinyein adumun jo kamana ace kere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi ŋesi aapienena kabulesin nuka Boas airarenen aitodol naedaunere aisak esairi ka aisak akima; kiboienenei katataake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.23",
